  "notes": "{苦痛|くつう} refers to significant physical or mental pain.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {苦痛|くつう}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{感|かん}じる→感じる：02044_kanjiru⟧ (to feel pain)\n- {苦痛|くつう}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{与|あた}える→与える：01821_ataeru⟧ (to cause pain)\n- {苦痛|くつう}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{耐|た}える→耐える：12087_taeru⟧ (to endure suffering)\n- {苦痛|くつう}⟦から→から：00504_kara⟧⟦{逃|のが}れる→逃れる：10425_nogareru⟧ (to escape from pain)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {苦痛|くつう}: pain, suffering (strong, formal)\n- ⟦{痛|いた}み→痛み：01795_itami⟧: pain (physical, general)\n- ⟦{苦|くる}しみ→苦しみ：14120_kurushimi⟧: suffering (emotional/physical)\n- ⟦{辛|つら}さ→辛さ：noentry⟧: hardship, difficulty",
